      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ESHELFORD PUDDING.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nMix three quarters of a pound of currants or raisins, one pound of suet, a pound of flour, six eggs, some good milk, lemon peel, and a little salt. Boil it in a melon shape six hours.\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E"
